BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:The Development Services Department will facilitate a voluntary
  training session for the Cochise County Planning and Zoning Commission on
  Friday\, October 2\, 2026. Commissioners will not discuss or deliberate o
 n official County business. This session is for Commission members only an
 d is not open to the public or subject to open meeting law. A quorum may b
 e present. https://www.cochise.az.gov/calendar.aspx?EID=2973
